@startuml
actor User
participant UI
participant BIFacadeImplementation
participant "db:DataAccess"
participant "User"
participant "db:EntityManager"

note left of User: Precondition:\nThe user is\nlogged in.\nSo we have the\nid of the user\nand password

User -> UI: Writes HowLongToBeat Id
User -> UI: Click "add"
UI -> BIFacadeImplementation: addAccounts(hltbID)
BIFacadeImplementation -> "db:DataAccess": addAccounts(hltbID)
"db:DataAccess" -> "db:EntityManager": createQuery(Q1)
"db:EntityManager" --> "db:DataAccess": <hltbID1, ..., hltbIDn>

note right of "db:EntityManager": Q1:\nSELECT hltbID\nFROM User s\nWHERE\n    s.userName=:?\n\n?1=$currentUserName

"db:DataAccess" --> BIFacadeImplementation: <hltbID1, ..., hltbIDn>

alt if account is already registered
    BIFacadeImplementation -> UI: displayError(hltbID)
else
    "db:DataAccess" -> "User": addAccounts(hltbID)
    "User" --> "db:DataAccess": Success
    "db:DataAccess" --> BIFacadeImplementation: Success
    BIFacadeImplementation --> UI: Success
end
@enduml
